    "FriendlyName": "MAXs Education DLSS 5 For UE5",
    "Description": "Unofficial NVIDIA Neural Rendering integration for Unreal Engine. MAXs Education controls, per-setting reset, automatic configuration saving, structure and tone controls, three object-mask groups, high-resolution screenshots, ON/OFF watermark and 4K Movie Render Queue sequences. Built for UE 5.8.4.",
